## Supply

Maximum Supply: AXS: 270.000.000 (fixed); SLP: Tidak ada maximum supply (unbounded, emission via gameplay); RON: 1.000.000.000 (fixed)
Total Supply: AXS: 270.000.000 (minted at genesis); SLP: Dynamic (tergantung mint/burn gameplay); RON: 1.000.000.000 (minted at genesis)
Circulating Supply: AXS: ~145.000.000 (per data on-chain 2024, termasuk staked); SLP: ~5.000.000.000+ (fluktuatif tinggi); RON: ~300.000.000+ (termasuk staked, per explorer 2024)
Initial Supply: AXS: 270.000.000 (full mint at genesis, TGE unlock 11%); SLP: 0 (fair launch, mint dari nol via gameplay); RON: 1.000.000.000 (full mint at genesis, distribusi bertahap)
Supply Type: AXS: Fixed; SLP: Inflationary (emission gameplay) dengan burn mechanism (breeding); RON: Fixed
