## Distribution

Community: AXS: 29.7M (11% Launchpad) + 20% Play-to-Earn rewards (54M) + 21% Staking rewards (56.7M) + 15% Ecosystem Fund (40.5M) = ~180.9M (67%) total alokasi komunitas/ekosistem; SLP: 100% komunitas via gameplay (fair launch); RON: 25% Community Rewards (250M) + 20% Validator Rewards (200M) = 450M (45%) komunitas/validator
Team: AXS: 20% (54M) — Sky Mavis team; SLP: 0%; RON: 30% (300M) — Sky Mavis
Investors: AXS: 15% (40.5M) — Series A/B investors; SLP: 0%; RON: 0% (tidak ada alokasi investor terpisah, investor memegang AXS)
Foundation: AXS: 14% (37.8M) — Sky Mavis Treasury/Foundation; SLP: 0%; RON: 25% (250M) — Ecosystem Fund (dikelola Sky Mavis/DAO)
Treasury: AXS: Termasuk dalam Foundation 14% + Staking rewards 21% (dikelola DAO); SLP: Tidak ada alokasi treasury; RON: 25% Ecosystem Fund (Foundation/DAO)
Ecosystem: AXS: 15% Ecosystem Fund (40.5M) + 21% Staking rewards (56.7M) = 97.2M (36%); SLP: 100% gameplay emission; RON: 25% Ecosystem Fund (250M) + 20% Validator Rewards (200M) = 450M (45%)
Advisors: AXS: Tidak terpisah (termasuk dalam Team/Investor); SLP: 0%; RON: 0%
Other: AXS: 10% Binance Launchpad (sudah termasuk Community 11%); SLP: -; RON: -
