## Governance

Governance Model: Dual-layer: AXS Governance (Axie Infinity Protocol & Community Treasury) + RON Governance (Ronin Network Parameters — planned/partial)
Voting System: Off-chain signaling (Snapshot gasless voting dengan veAXS/staked AXS weight) → On-chain execution (Timelock multisig oleh Guardian/DAO); RON: On-chain voting via Ronin Governance contracts (direncanakan)
Voting Power: AXS: 1 staked AXS = 1 vote (veAXS/ staked AXS); RON: 1 staked RON = 1 vote (direncanakan)
Delegation: AXS: Delegasi voting power ke delegate lain via Snapshot delegation; RON: Delegasi ke validator (staking) secara implisit
Proposal System: AXS: Forum discussion (gov.axieinfinity.com) → Snapshot vote (quorum 4M AXS, passing >50%) → Timelock execution (48 jam); RON: On-chain proposal → Validator voting → Timelock (direncanakan)
Treasury Governance: AXS: Community Treasury (alamat 0xF40...) dikendalikan sepenuhnya oleh AXS staker via proposal; Sky Mavis operational treasury terpisah tidak dikendalikan DAO
Status: Live (AXS Governance); Planned/Partial (RON Governance)
Sources: (HIGH) [Axie Gov Forum, https://gov.axieinfinity.com/]; [Snapshot AXS, https://snapshot.org/#/axieinfinity.eth]; [Axie Docs Governance, https://docs.axieinfinity.com/governance/]; [Ronin Docs Governance, https://docs.roninchain.com/ronin/governance/overview]; [Ronin Gov Forum, https://forum.roninchain.com/]; [Whitepaper v1.1, https://whitepaper.axieinfinity.com/]

## Inflation / Deflation

Inflation Mechanism: AXS: Tidak ada inflasi (fixed supply 270M); emisi staking reward berasal dari alokasi tetap 21% supply (56.7M) yang tercapai dalam ~5-10 tahun; SLP: Inflation via gameplay mint (unbounded) — rate tergantung jumlah pemain aktif dan reward per match; RON: Tidak ada inflasi (fixed supply 1B); emisi validator reward berasal dari alokasi tetap 20% supply (200M) yang didistribusikan per epoch
Emission Schedule: AXS: Staking reward emisi menurun seiring participation rate naik (kurva logaritmik tidak dipublikasikan detail); SLP: Per block/match reward (dynamic, disesuaikan seasonal); RON: Per epoch reward ke validator/delegator (halving schedule tidak resmi dipublikasikan)
Burn Mechanism: AXS: Tidak ada burn mechanism native (kecuali breeding fee AXS yang masuk Treasury, tidak di-burn); SLP: Burn wajib saat breeding Axie (jumlah besar, primary deflationary pressure); RON: Gas fee burn mechanism (EIP-1559 style) — base fee di-burn, priority fee ke validator (sejak DPoS upgrade 2023)
Buyback: Tidak ada program buyback resmi untuk AXS, SLP, atau RON
Supply Reduction: SLP: Burn breeding (variable, jutaan per hari pada peak); RON: Gas fee burn (base fee) mengurangi circulating supply secara bertahap; AXS: Tidak ada supply reduction mechanism
Status: Live (SLP burn, RON gas burn); No burn (AXS)
Sources: (HIGH) [Whitepaper v1.1, https://whitepaper.axieinfinity.com/]; [Axie Docs Breeding, https://docs.axieinfinity.com/game-mechanics/breeding]; [Ronin Docs RON Token, https://docs.roninchain.com/ronin/token/ron]; [Blog Ronin PoS Launch, https://blog.roninchain.com/ronin-pos-launch]; [Ronin Explorer Gas Burn, https://explorer.roninchain.com/]; [Axie Docs Staking, https://docs.axieinfinity.com/staking/]

